    <typeMember xsi:type="spoon:CtMethod" name="classify">
      <comment xsi:type="spoon:CtJavaDoc" commentContent="The cycle's event, in order of precedence: three successive STOPs, a&#xA;transmission failure, a limit risk (outside initialisation), the first&#xA;STEAM_BOILER_WAITING, PHYSICAL_UNITS_READY, any other transmission.&#xA;PHYSICAL_UNITS_READY reaching this point is legitimate: anywhere else it&#xA;is aberrant, so already a transmission failure."/>
